    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but isn't the \"order\" you're talking about often just a way to justify systemic inequality? like, if the legal system is already biased, then retributive justice basically just becomes a tool for punishing marginalized groups more harshly. shouldn't a \"morally sound\" system prioritize fixing those broken cycles rather than just leaning into them?",
